PK-␀␀␀␀␀␀␀a].'ÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ&␀␀RUNTIME/python/tcl/tix8.4.3/pref/TK.cs␀␀#␀␀␀␀␀␀#␀␀␀␀␀␀#
# $Id: TK.cs,v 1.1.1.1 2000/05/17 11:08:47 idiscovery Exp $
