PK-␀␀␀␀␀␀␀a]¢ÈEQÿÿÿÿÿÿÿÿ␀␀START_QA.cmd␀␀½␀␀␀␀␀␀␀½␀␀␀␀␀␀␀@echo off
setlocal
cd /d "%~dp0"
